    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{47x}{8}-\\frac{3}{2}$\n\nExpand four products and collect like terms.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac{x}{4}-3\\right)\\left(2x+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)&=\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x}{8}-6x-\\frac{3}{2}\\\\\\left(\\frac{x}{4}-3\\right)\\left(2x+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)&=\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{47x}{8}-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
